{"judgments": [
  {"clause_id": "c014",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "The clause provides that Section 3 \"shall survive the termination of this Agreement,\" but the Agreement contains no term, expiration or termination mechanism anywhere, so there is no event for the survival language to operate on. A court could be asked what, if anything, the survival sentence adds to the perpetual obligation already imposed by Section 3(A).", "type": 1, "prob": 0.20}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c015",
